pts that we can  manipulate we need to recognize as as we  said before that ethical concepts are  actually pseudo concepts that what they  reveal to us is ultimately just an  expression of preference or feeling or  moral sentiment or the attempts to get  other people to feel the same or to  produce action on their part acting as a  sort of disguised command so error is  going to criticize all three of these  main approaches very common in his time  in ethics saying that the the radical  empiricist or a motive isten that he is  developing is superior to them  you
 

